        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The following apps come from the App Store or are owned by the system (root) and are protected by macOS:\n\n%@\n\nAppPorts copies each app to external storage in full first, then deletes the local copy.\n\nmacOS will ask for your administrator password when the local copy is deleted, and you will hear the Trash sound. Both are normal — approve the prompt and AppPorts finishes the rest automatically."
          }
