        "br" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⠠⠞⠓⠑ ⠎⠞⠁⠛⠑⠙ ⠎⠓⠕⠗⠞⠉⠥⠞ ⠓⠁⠎ ⠝⠕ ⠎⠁⠧⠑⠙ ⠕⠺⠝⠑⠗⠎⠓⠊⠏ ⠗⠑⠉⠕⠗⠙ ⠽⠑⠞⠲ ⠠⠽⠕⠥ ⠉⠁⠝ ⠉⠁⠝⠉⠑⠇ ⠞⠓⠊⠎ ⠁⠞⠞⠑⠍⠏⠞ ⠁⠝⠙ ⠅⠑⠑⠏ ⠞⠓⠑ ⠊⠞⠑⠍⠲"
