          }
        },
        "br" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "⠞⠓⠑ ⠙⠁⠞⠁ ⠺⠁⠎ ⠍⠊⠛⠗⠁⠞⠑⠙, ⠃⠥⠞ ⠗⠑-⠎⠊⠛⠝⠊⠝⠛ ⠞⠓⠑ ⠁⠎⠎⠕⠉⠊⠁⠞⠑⠙ ⠁⠏⠏⠇⠊⠉⠁⠞⠊⠕⠝ ⠋⠁⠊⠇⠑⠙: %@\n\n⠗⠑⠞⠗⠽ ⠗⠑-⠎⠊⠛⠝⠊⠝⠛ ⠋⠗⠕⠍ ⠞⠓⠑ ⠁⠏⠏⠇⠊⠉⠁⠞⠊⠕⠝ ⠇⠊⠎⠞, ⠕⠗ ⠗⠑⠎⠞⠕⠗⠑ ⠞⠓⠑ ⠙⠁⠞⠁ ⠙⠊⠗⠑⠉⠞⠕⠗⠽."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
